    /* → /404.html catch-all, and the success page is fetched as an ordinary
    request once the POST is handled. test/contact.test.js pins the form's
    action to a built file for exactly that reason.

    noindex, and deliberately out of the sitemap: it is the /checkout/done/
    case — thin, transactional, and meaningless to anyone who arrives at it
    cold. It answers no search. One primary action, back to the product. -#}

